## Hypothesis
Pip resolver is backtracking across wide dependency ranges for `fastapi[standard]` and related extras; constraints or lockfile needed.
Render is deploying commit `e807952` where `/demo` was removed, so the configured root directory no longer exists.
Render is still using `pip install .` instead of Dockerfile/`uv.lock`, so the resolver error persists.

